    "changed_decision": "no_historical_evidence",
    "explanation": "No prior study directly examined cut-heavy vs drive-heavy shapers. The historical evidence informs risks (low CUT base rate, difficulty of individual prediction) and provides a validated travel framework, but does not answer the question."
